{"seq":1,"slug":"cookies-and-session","title":"Cookie 与会话","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/storage-apis/cookies-and-session","wordCount":569,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"cookie-与会话\">Cookie 与会话</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Cookie 是服务器通过 <code>Set-Cookie</code> 响应头下发、浏览器在后续请求中自动携带的小段数据，是会话管理的基础。其安全依赖三个属性：<strong>HttpOnly</strong> 阻止 JS 读取、<strong>Secure</strong> 限定 HTTPS 传输、<strong>SameSite</strong>（现代浏览器默认 <code>Lax</code>）防御 CSRF。Cookie 容量极小且每次请求都会携带，第三方 Cookie 正逐步淘汰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cookie-的基本概念\">Cookie 的基本概念</h2><p><strong>Cookie</strong> 是服务器通过 HTTP 响应头发送给浏览器的小段数据，浏览器会在后续请求中自动携带。Cookie 是 Web 应用实现会话管理、用户偏好存储和行为追踪的基础机制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Browser as 浏览器&#10;    participant Server as 服务器&#10;&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /login (无 Cookie)&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 + Set-Cookie: sid=abc123&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /dashboard (Cookie: sid=abc123)&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 (已认证的响应)&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/data (Cookie: sid=abc123)&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 (数据)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Browser as 浏览器\n    participant Server as 服务器\n\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /login (无 Cookie)\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 + Set-Cookie: sid=abc123\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /dashboard (Cookie: sid=abc123)\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 (已认证的响应)\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/data (Cookie: sid=abc123)\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 (数据)</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cookie-属性详解\">Cookie 属性详解</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Name=Value</code></td>\n<td>Cookie 名称和值</td>\n<td><code>session_id=abc123</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Domain</code></td>\n<td>生效域名</td>\n<td><code>.example.com</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Path</code></td>\n<td>生效路径</td>\n<td><code>/app</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Expires</code></td>\n<td>过期时间（绝对时间）</td>\n<td><code>Thu, 01 Jan 2027 00:00:00 GMT</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Max-Age</code></td>\n<td>过期时间（相对秒数）</td>\n<td><code>86400</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Secure</code></td>\n<td>仅通过 HTTPS 传输</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HttpOnly</code></td>\n<td>禁止 JS 访问</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SameSite</code></td>\n<td>跨站请求限制</td>\n<td><code>Strict</code> / <code>Lax</code> / <code>None</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CookieOptions {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  value: string;&#10;  maxAge?: number;&#10;  path?: string;&#10;  domain?: string;&#10;  secure?: boolean;&#10;  httpOnly?: boolean;&#10;  sameSite?: &#39;Strict&#39; | &#39;Lax&#39; | &#39;None&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function setCookie(options: Omit&lt;CookieOptions, &#39;httpOnly&#39;&gt;): void {&#10;  let cookie = `${encodeURIComponent(options.name)}=${encodeURIComponent(options.value)}`;&#10;&#10;  if (options.maxAge !== undefined) cookie += `; max-age=${options.maxAge}`;&#10;  if (options.path) cookie += `; path=${options.path}`;&#10;  if (options.domain) cookie += `; domain=${options.domain}`;&#10;  if (options.secure) cookie += &#39;; secure&#39;;&#10;  if (options.sameSite) cookie += `; samesite=${options.sameSite}`;&#10;&#10;  document.cookie = cookie;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function getCookie(name: string): string | null {&#10;  const match = document.cookie.match(new RegExp(`(?:^|;\\\\s*)${name}=([^;]*)`));&#10;  return match ? decodeURIComponent(match[1]) : null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function deleteCookie(name: string, path = &#39;/&#39;): void {&#10;  document.cookie = `${name}=; max-age=0; path=${path}`;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\